<title>USA: U.S. stocks open higher, techs surge.</title>
<headline>U.S. stocks open higher, techs surge.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wall Street stocks opened higher on Friday despite mild weakness in bonds as Dow's ferocious bull trend continues. Nasdaq surged on strength in techs, and a one point rise in IBM boosted Dows.</p>
<p>The Dow industrials average was up 9.69 to 6428.16</p>
</text>
